    {
      "short": "Cache-aside",
      "chapter": "solution",
      "title": "Look in the cache first",
      "body": [
        "Add a <span class=\"term\">cache</span>: a small, fast in-memory store of recent answers. With the <span class=\"term\">cache-aside</span> pattern the app checks the cache first. On a <b>hit</b>, it returns the stored answer in about a millisecond.",
        "On a <b>miss</b>, it queries the database as before, then writes the result into the cache for next time. Just after a restart the cache is cold: only 35% of requests hit."
      ],
      "changes": [
        "+ Cache (cache-aside)",
        "~ Misses fill the cache"
      ],
